│ patch_description        │ Replace the degenerate all-zero construction with a deterministic, vectorized             │
│                          │ differential-evolution search over eight free points while fixing the three vertices of   │
│                          │ the containing equilateral triangle. Points are parameterized by barycentric coordinates, │
│                          │ so every candidate is guaranteed to remain inside the triangle. The objective evaluates   │
│                          │ all 165 triples simultaneously and maximizes their minimum doubled area. A final          │
│                          │ deterministic local batch search refines the best evolutionary candidate. This avoids     │
│                          │ optional optimization dependencies, uses a fixed seed, and includes a finite fallback     │
│                          │ path because the initial population always supplies a valid arrangement.                  │
