│                          │ and final polishing into distinct stages. It avoids redundant minimum-area evaluations by │
│                          │ computing all triangle determinants once per population, then reuses them for ranking,    │
│                          │ elite extraction, and active-constraint detection. Late generations add focused offspring │
│                          │ mutations targeted at points participating in the smallest-area triples, followed by a    │
│                          │ deterministic active-set local polish of the best configuration.                          │
