│ patch_description        │ Replace the all-score-based elite truncation with diversity-aware survivor selection. The │
│                          │ current population rapidly becomes a collection of nearly identical relabelings or small  │
│                          │ perturbations of one basin, which makes both differential donors and crossover            │
│                          │ ineffective. This edit preserves the ten highest tail-guided candidates exactly, then     │
│                          │ selects the remaining six from a larger high-quality pool by greedy maximin distance      │
│                          │ after lexicographically sorting the eight movable points. Sorting makes the distance      │
│                          │ insensitive to arbitrary point labels. The true best layout remains explicitly retained   │
│                          │ because it is selected from the quality-leading prefix and separately tracked by the      │
│                          │ existing exact-objective archive.                                                         │
